{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "25bae53323cb4ac233189e1be609276a59d62f63f9325b7d24eb9bfcdb09f698", "ja": "（今日は、亜利沙の宣材写真を撮りにきた。けど\n当の亜利沙が、撮影よりスタジオ見学に夢中だ……）", "zh": "（今天要拍亚利沙的宣传照。可是比起拍照，\n当事人亚利沙更沉迷于参观摄影棚……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "5aa97c3d54b92ab8e019562aea66cc7e68b4769f9e570c06a99aa033e97c10ea", "ja": "ふぉぉ……このスタジオが、\nあのアイドルちゃんを撮影したという、伝説の……！", "zh": "唔喔喔……这间摄影棚，\n就是拍摄了那位偶像宝贝、传说中的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "28211ab857af55ca4d83be179a9c5428ec2aa8cdb89a034534c4d1f3a367be6d", "ja": "そんな場所に来られるなんて、ありさ、感激ですーっ！\nまずは、記念に1枚……。", "zh": "居然能来到这种地方，亚利沙超感激──！\n先拍一张纪念照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a7a525f585eaa347aaf81d86ec414ea5213665e7320ddafb65a849a84950e7c2", "ja": "こら、亜利沙。\n今日は撮る方じゃなく、撮ってもらう方だろ？", "zh": "喂喂，亚利沙。\n你今天的任务不是摄影师，是被拍摄的主角吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "6063ed0c9b96109a628897ed4ed94c63605eea9d7473d76fc1f3d3a0ac9e092d", "ja": "ハッ……そ、そうでしたっ。\n今日は、ありさの宣材写真を撮るんでした……。", "zh": "啊……对、对耶。\n今天是要拍亚利沙的宣传照……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "96f98234f6afa4cdb8bc3ac410255323c5823cfab32fedc04304539c3dc0335e", "ja": "思い出してくれたか。\nそれじゃあ、さっそく準備して撮影だ！", "zh": "你想起来了吗。\n那就赶快做好准备来拍照吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "80c7dc129c1fd441bf3776664277e2ba998be0fa6af5b8cc129de95abc8bf29b", "ja": "は、はいっ。\nそうですよね、ありさの撮影を……。", "zh": "好、好的！\n说得也是，拍亚利沙的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "1eb147d15d06c3db9dadd37de9f2df656951aa25f9a963853b66d229069f9884", "ja": "ううっ。", "zh": "呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "31cc88be3384734065664d9aae20d6c0fe10635062e990ce174fb3b68adfbabf", "ja": "亜利沙、どうかしたのか？\n急に肩を落としたりして……。", "zh": "亚利沙，怎么了吗？\n突然变得这么沮丧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "268cb85906e9ba828927173acd83a45e85ff64c614b656386b68a1ebc2b307bb", "ja": "いえ……ありさ、撮影されるんだって思ったら、\n急に緊張してきちゃいまして……。", "zh": "没有……亚利沙一想到要被拍，\n就突然紧张了起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "3220b9242afbcc7cb1194b4b8a3cd2f270228a0b7e7e736e57f7ce4374ee9564", "ja": "アイドルちゃんの写真を、何百、いえ何千枚も\n見続けてきたありさだからこそ、わかるんです……。", "zh": "正因为亚利沙至今已经看过了几百几千张\n偶像宝贝的照片，所以更明白这点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "41c750b452ac4745cffba3fa240e7e63923a7059387279def637772a3e20a04e", "ja": "……というと？", "zh": "……什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "7843d45f26ff207df71667bf938f20ddb7d358cc189196f4e6aa055ae00ae75d", "ja": "ズバリ！\n撮られるコトが、どれほど難しいかを……！", "zh": "也就是说！\n要被人拍，是多么困难的一件事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "4f885b97f8f825fbecf501d961e4e738aee16b0457e1fdb3ea2ec3080030c820", "ja": "撮られる技術……いえっ、撮らせる技術っ！\nそれはとっても、高度なものなんですっ！", "zh": "被拍的技术……不，是让人拍的技术！\n这是非常高难度的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "11fc2cd9e941ee6f9f0cc5d562e6fbda9699b77623132cd9d99a29406a6bb9dc", "ja": "というワケで、{$P$}さん！\nありさ、カメラマンさんと交代したらダメですか？", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}先生！\n不能让亚利沙跟摄影师交换吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "beb11c2fdaee924ef57875130cb00d9d6f379488ac8091a5456c4f22a3e3da14", "ja": "ダメに決まってるだろう。だいたい、\n亜利沙の写真を撮ってもらわなくてどうするんだ。", "zh": "当然不行啊。再说，\n不让摄影师拍亚利沙的照片，要怎么完成工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "8ce8ba80835e0def24485b33e0871e828bf365ca59dc4a4943461a056d3ff820", "ja": "でもでも！　今のありさでは、カメラマンさんに\nキレイに撮ってもらえる自信がありませんよぉ……。", "zh": "可是可是！\n现在的亚利沙没自信让摄影师拍出好看的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a49ae878e079bbe4bef5dd8524a8eb8659756aa2e4b66e1be6b9b7ae0507fd24", "ja": "そう言われてもな……。亜利沙は、\n好きなアイドルの新しい写真を見たくないのか？", "zh": "你这样说我也很伤脑筋……\n亚利沙不会想看喜欢的偶像的新照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "2a11e142b6a2cab50b1e83adbc51457c79913d04e398a3897066c30f8bb81311", "ja": "そりゃもう！\n全力で見たいに決まってるじゃないですかーっ！！", "zh": "那还用说！\n当然超级无敌想看啊──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6c614f2f736a20cfb5e9065704490e5de93ac158abb7b11e4bfe300e122a1046", "ja": "そうだよな。\nじゃあ、新しい衣装を着ているところは？", "zh": "我想也是。\n那么，她们穿着新服装的模样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "a3fc94f2762ff05a1d438a5a8c24c0a8e1621a8e5323043eaf6583c7279becdd", "ja": "もちろん見たいです！　新しい衣装を\n着たアイドルちゃん……ワクワクしますっ！", "zh": "当然想看！\n穿上新服装的偶像宝贝……好让人兴奋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1021_p", "source_sha256": "eb5bcbc5cd3c0f1833bc2a61bfcb71ad4bc15170c0eb279a1630a2a906051bf3", "ja": "そうだよな。なら亜利沙も、\nファンのみんなのために頑張らないとな？", "zh": "没错。\n那亚利沙也得为了粉丝们努力对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "25fc3951b54e5d21c20fb6116a90b4a90bba3f765369c90462523f3daaca7f8c", "ja": "ハッ！？", "zh": "啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1023_p", "source_sha256": "010c8d089cacc4e1f20aa5de5d800eb01ad273974407faebef4ce48bd2c8fbb7", "ja": "今はまだ実感が湧かないかもしれないけど、\n亜利沙にだって、ファンの人がつくんだ。", "zh": "虽然你现在可能还没有真实感，\n但亚利沙也会有粉丝的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1024_p", "source_sha256": "debc76c12b0f93e61592c79c1c08ce6712cab2d1f51218a08cad9fb001faa37f", "ja": "だからその人達が喜んでくれるように、頑張ろう。\n全部が、最高の1枚じゃなくたっていいんだ。", "zh": "所以为了让那些人开心，你要加油。\n即便并非每张照片都拍得很完美，也无所谓。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "8abd07e9b60638bb58062f06c653d80af95f9659408a13d18e670c8b804c5823", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\nありさは……ありさは、覚悟を決めました！", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n亚利沙……亚利沙做好觉悟了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "208f3b4b4fce8a74d46e8bb2e1abeccbc2a3fa914a95f4b93082226d767ab28f", "ja": "ありさのことを応援してくれる方々のためにも、\nベストショット撮ってもらってきますね！！", "zh": "为了支持亚利沙的粉丝们，\n亚利沙要去拍出最佳照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "e6466c8229bd3d7abdf41141502ff8d00b7b220250892eb51adddc698e1dba15", "ja": "（亜利沙はそう言い残すと、\nカメラマンさんのところへと駆けていった……）", "zh": "（亚利沙说完这句话，\n便跑向摄影师那边……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_028ari_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_028ari_002_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c9110655921a3131b02e6e663b6671b0d48b54abdecf0fcd9854ffa895468878", "ja": "（散々尻込みしてたけど、決心がついたようだ。\n亜利沙のアイドル愛の深さ故、だな！）", "zh": "（虽然犹豫了很久，但她似乎是下定决心了。\n这也是多亏亚利沙深切热爱偶像吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
